  "solution": {
    "text": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The initial reaction  is the controlled reduction of alkyne to alkene using Lindlar's catalyst <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>Pd</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>BaSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>)</mo></math>, followed by hydroboration reaction of alkene, which gives primary alcohol.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/image43-8a8df15b-4784-4501-ae49-59c2260a1f4f.png\"/></p>",
